    "bcecfea6ef3dcdcda5efa606805020d2": {
      "title": "Rumah Gadang, Jantung Kehidupan Minangkabau",
      "content": "A magnificent traditional Minangkabau Rumah Gadang, specifically resembling the Pagaruyung Palace style. It features multiple tiered, dramatically curved roofs that sweep upwards to sharp points, mimicking buffalo horns. The extensive wooden walls are dark brown, adorned with intricate and vibrant wood carvings (ukiran) in red, gold, and black floral and geometric motifs. The house is substantially elevated on sturdy wooden stilts. A grand central staircase leads to the main entrance, flanked by numerous small rectangular windows. High quality 3D model of detailed Indonesian architecture.",
      "modelUrl": "https://tripo-data.rg1.data.tripo3d.com/tcli_6b8091f40b6c4584860980296de514b2/20251123/9f979f34-455c-49a7-9142-8f36207c0d81/tripo_pbr_model_9f979f34-455c-49a7-9142-8f36207c0d81.glb?_&Signature=vpa~DXT-hoqfFApt1St6~mhZcztFfgIEYn~bT63GstbtoDRvI68GZLwJVkFiQ1LSVcdRnsbRFcGw7pp0WIsbgwIX3O4rxyAfXBo0hym59F-UWVdKV0nGx-~4l7-6pHSe32o2R1hjjMlyHajNwazsYry~ts3r84wCqo6fiQFk~q5OGyJYRCjDAtZawoUmrb-rrongVsO6DpUE-eQ3jjAKbnyrvwIPe3tEpoj6FrRSENl3b-dnivZZa4WDXs4cuPW89RHtpb~A-wZGXoup3bDBCEUsXnmHFlEYldBnWIeHCfN8g~RfzZJOcdO6m4aDVoDbSNaRvy0lE87zwejNlEDm9A__&Key-Pair-Id=K1676C64NMVM2J",
