    "863cc55d1bd150d5323b1b7ce40cd9f7": {
      "title": "Kemegahan Rumah Gadang",
      "content": "A magnificent traditional Minangkabau Rumah Gadang, featuring a prominent, multi-tiered curved roof with 11 distinct 'gonjong' peaks, meticulously covered with dark brown ijuk (palm fiber) shingles. The entire exterior is crafted from warm reddish-brown wooden planks, extensively adorned with intricate geometric and floral wood carvings in vibrant red, black, and gold/yellow pigments. The grand structure is significantly raised approximately 2-3 meters above ground on sturdy dark wooden stilts, with an ornate central wooden staircase leading to the main entrance. The lower base and support beams are also richly carved. Detailed Indonesian architecture, high quality 3D model.",
      "modelUrl": "https://tripo-data.rg1.data.tripo3d.com/tcli_6b8091f40b6c4584860980296de514b2/20251123/db5aba8d-7164-40d6-b0ce-32f16dcc2400/tripo_pbr_model_db5aba8d-7164-40d6-b0ce-32f16dcc2400.glb?_&Signature=iqsHZIskKF8hj5iof90jpVXSoQolUCLlfmD-8LcOeK~DpCm1zyjqbaPagJhkKtn~V7VDcaDqpSmtrR14t058NhdigyAG8hXVYFXw0XKONWfy8DVLE-VBnE2v~KNk31gT8J8e6iCFHGibigRwWbl3dLRD42Q4ZAdPXPJfsjSdDKkaspp591SWHrY1on9TMGHqr8mLC51WCU7k43~zf29jo52Kv6RXRgf7bJKTGTsAthYBhBI0aM9lcIfQPmj2g2FSCQwls4R6ggPN4WTgLNyfh2xafzrPYK5sTrCN-DYpLAaTJulrmuT0i4QTLSS7-tbzUnA9xNDnlpjbhVk-Dpislg__&Key-Pair-Id=K1676C64NMVM2J",
